      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Little between the top few. TUSKEGEE (1) returned from a break this course and distance and after racing just off the lead kept coming and just missed. Fitter for the run and can go one better. STARDARMUS (6) was disappointing on the turf over a mile two back then dropped back to this course and distance last time and led throughout for a four length win. Take catching with a repeat. SIMPLY DEEP (3) was a neck winner this course and distance two back then again dug deep to score here latest. Hard to fault recent attitude and sure to be in the finish again. KIREINA MARUBRAH (7) is coming back in trip and best form is over this journey. Worth following up. THE SPIRIT OF ZERO (4) will be winding up strongly.",
